 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server selects the supported language with the highest
+positive `q` value in `Accept-Language`. An omitted `q` defaults to `1`, and ties
+follow header order. Region tags such as `ko-KR` match their base language.
+When there is no supported preference, the server uses `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
